		<Section>Learning Goals</Section>
		<Content height="484" width="756" x="273" y="68" padding="20" hasBackground="true" bgColor="#ffffff" bgAlpha="0.9">
			<![CDATA[<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px; color:#404448"><b>Learning Goals</b></p>
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color:#404448">Welcome to this learning session on <b>IMTP Univ: Supporting Individuals with Disabilities</b> In this course we shall address:</p><ul style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color:#404448"><li>Our Mission and Vision</li><li>Understanding Developmental Disabilities</li><li>Person-First Language and Respectful Communication</li><li>Role of a Direct Support Professional</li><li>Importance of Documentation and Reporting</li><li>Person-Centered Support</li><li>Effective Communication Strategies</li><li>Emergency Response and Crisis Management</li><li>Professional Growth and Teamwork</li></ul><p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">There will be a quiz at the end to test your knowledge.</p>]]>
		</Content>
