		<Section>Our Mission and Vision</Section>
		<Content height="350" width="462" x="0" y="108" padding="20" hasBackground="true" bgColor="#ffffff" bgAlpha="0.9" auto_narrator="true">
			<![CDATA[<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px; color:#404448"><b>Our Mission and Vision</b></p>
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">The mission of Include Me Too Please is to empower individuals with disabilities by promoting independence and stability. We aim to create a supportive environment where every person can realize their full potential. Our commitment extends to families and support systems, ensuring that individuals become their most independent and successful selves.</p>]]>
		</Content>
		<Flash x="" y="" width="" height="" targetId="" text="" textColor="#000000">swf/empty_1.swf</Flash>
		<Narrator/>


		<Video/>
		<Background>images/670fdb25d5707.jpg</Background>
		<navigation/>
	</screen>
	<screen>
		<screen_id x="0" y="0">201</screen_id>
		<Template>4</Template>
		
		<Content height="296" width="496" x="525" y="133" padding="20" hasBackground="true" bgColor="#ffffff" bgAlpha="0.9" auto_narrator="true">
			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Our vision is to build inclusive communities where individuals with disabilities are not only integrated but celebrated for their unique strengths. We believe in fostering environments where empowerment, respect, and compassion are at the forefront. By promoting these values, we aim to create a society where everyone feels valued and has a voice.</p>]]>
		</Content>
		
		<Narrator/>


		<Video/>
		<Background>images/67114e9b0aea1.jpg</Background>
		<navigation/>
	</screen>
	<screen>
		<screen_id x="0" y="0">202</screen_id>
		<Template>4</Template>
		
		<Content height="172" width="779" x="250" y="286" padding="20" hasBackground="true" bgColor="#ffffff" bgAlpha="0.9" auto_narrator="true">
			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Core values such as inclusion, respect, empowerment, compassion, and teamwork guide our mission. Inclusion ensures everyone belongs and is heard, while respect honors the dignity of each person. Empowerment supports self-determination, and teamwork encourages collaboration with individuals, families, and professionals.</p>]]>
		</Content>
		
		<Narrator/>


		<Video/>
		<Background>images/AoGAleOgq0LOnxfuKt0ccQB17wtxIykGtbVT1GLm.jpg</Background>
		<navigation/>
	</screen>
	<screen>
		<screen_id x="0" y="0">3</screen_id>
