			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Daily logs and service notes must be written clearly and objectively. These records capture significant events and interactions, providing a comprehensive overview of the individual's day. They serve as a vital tool for tracking progress and identifying areas needing attention.</p>]]>
