			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Special Incident Reporting (SIR) is a critical component of documentation. Understanding what qualifies as a reportable incident and adhering to timelines is essential. Clear and urgent reporting helps ensure the safety and well-being of individuals under care.</p>]]>
