		<Section>Person-Centered Support</Section>
		<Content height="412" width="407" x="86" y="104" padding="20" hasBackground="true" bgColor="#ffffff" bgAlpha="0.9" auto_narrator="true">
			<![CDATA[<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 16px; color:#404448"><b>Person-Centered Support</b></p>
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Person-centered support is about tailoring services to fit the unique needs and preferences of each individual. It emphasizes the importance of understanding a person's history, goals, and cultural background. This approach ensures that support plans are not just generic solutions but are truly reflective of what the individual values and desires.</p>]]>
		</Content>
