		<Content height="296" width="407" x="86" y="162" padding="20" hasBackground="true" bgColor="#ffffff" bgAlpha="0.9" auto_narrator="true">
			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Creating individualized routines is a core component of person-centered support. These routines should align with the individual's daily habits and long-term aspirations. By collaborating with the person, support providers can develop structures that enhance the individual's quality of life and promote independence.</p>]]>
		</Content>
		
		<Narrator/>

