			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Cultural competency is essential in delivering person-centered support. It involves respecting and acknowledging diverse backgrounds, identities, and belief systems. Understanding cultural influences on behavior and communication can lead to more effective and meaningful interactions with individuals.</p>]]>
