			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Augmentative and Alternative Communication (AAC) tools are vital for those who do not use verbal speech. These tools, such as picture boards and communication apps, provide a voice to individuals who might otherwise struggle to express themselves. Implementing AAC effectively requires patience and understanding from support professionals.</p>]]>
		</Content>
		
