			<![CDATA[
			<p style="font-family: SANS-SERIF; font-size: 24px; color:#404448">Medical emergencies demand quick thinking and a thorough understanding of basic first aid protocols. DSPs should be familiar with procedures for handling seizures, choking, and falls, ensuring safety until professional medical help arrives. Knowing when to call emergency services is crucial to prevent further harm and provide timely assistance.</p>]]>
		</Content>
		
